  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>k</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>,&nbsp;if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>119</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>k</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now subtracting above equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now finding,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>110</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>110</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>119</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
